Error [jet.PrivateFailureMemberExposed]: Public fallible function `check_token` exposes non-public failure carrier member `MethodTokenError`.
  --> tests/ui/e2421_priv_carrier_named_whole.jet:5:6
    |
  5 | priv MethodTokenError: struct { reason: String }
    |      ^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^^
 Why: The public failure contract makes `MethodTokenError` part of the callable's visible carrier, but its declaration is not public.
 Fix: Remove `priv` from `MethodTokenError` or move it out of its `priv module`, or move `check_token` into a `priv module`.
More: jet-lang.dev/e/E2421
